  <description>Simulated Intel RealSense D435i depth camera for Gazebo Harmonic. Geometry and sensor offsets from realsense2_description URDF (_d435.urdf.xacro, _d435i_imu_modules.urdf.xacro). Streams 424x240 @ 30 Hz with D435i FOV (RGB 69.4 deg, depth 87 deg HFOV). RealSense-compatible topics: camera/color/image_raw, camera/aligned_depth_to_color/image_raw, camera/imu.</description>
</model>
